  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T K.116 establishes the essential electromagnetic compatibility (EMC) requirements for radio telecommunication terminal equipment and ancillary accessories. This Recommendation specifies the emission and immunity requirements for radio telecommunication terminal equipment and ancillary equipment including 5G terminal equipment. It also describes test conditions for emission and immunity testing. Performance assessment and criteria for immunity tests are also specified.</abstract>
